      "html": "<p>Antecume Pata in the upper Maroni River basin, French Guiana. Type locality: Marouini River, vicinity of Antecume Pata, French Guiana. Also recorded from Guyana waters, coastal rivers of the Guianas, Suriname coastal rivers, Marowijne and Upper Marowijne.</p>"
